Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Receptor Connection Problems
Symptoms: Nodes not appearing in AWX or jobs failing to execute

Solutions:

# Check receptor service status
sudo systemctl status receptor

# Verify network connectivity
telnet control-node 27199

# Check firewall settings
sudo firewall-cmd --list-all
sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=27199/tcp --permanent
sudo firewall-cmd --reload

# Review receptor logs
sudo journalctl -u receptor -n 50
Issue 2: AWX Pod Issues
Symptoms: AWX not accessible or pods crashing

Solutions:

# Check pod status
kubectl get pods

# Check pod logs
kubectl logs -l app.kubernetes.io/name=awx-mesh-demo

# Restart AWX deployment
kubectl rollout restart deployment/awx-mesh-demo-web
kubectl rollout restart deployment/awx-mesh-demo-task
Issue 3: Job Execution Failures
Symptoms: Jobs fail to run on mesh nodes

Solutions:

# Verify ansible-runner installation on mesh nodes
ansible-runner --version

# Check instance group assignments
# In AWX: Administration → Instance Groups

# Verify inventory and credentials
# In AWX: Resources → Inventories → Hosts
Issue 4: Performance Issues
Symptoms: Slow job execution or timeouts

Solutions:

# Check system resources
htop
df -h

# Monitor receptor performance
receptor --socket /tmp/receptor-control.sock status

# Adjust receptor configuration for better performance
# Add to receptor.conf:
# - tcp-listener:
#     port: 27199
#     cost: 1
